  "term": "DEA",
  "definition": "DEA, in this source, refers to an efficiency-analysis approach used to evaluate how effectively resources are allocated and to compare efficiency across regions. It is presented as a way to study both overall and component aspects of allocation efficiency and whether performance reaches an efficiency frontier.",
